IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ucta-nouns`

-- UCTA: constructors used by the test files.  Not a provision of the Act and not a test:
-- there is no record-update operator in L4, so each test builds its facts through these.

§ `Test fixtures`

-- A Scope facts record from its nine facts, in the order of the DECLARE.
GIVEN business IS A BOOLEAN
      kind IS A `Kind of contract`
      relates IS A `What the contract relates to`
      carried IS A BOOLEAN
      specifies IS A BOOLEAN
      silent IS A BOOLEAN
      operates IS A BOOLEAN
      consumer IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      employee IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Scope facts`
`mk scope` MEANS
    `Scope facts` OF business, kind, relates, carried, specifies, silent, operates, consumer, employee

-- An ordinary business-liability case under a services contract that touches nothing in the First
-- Schedule, where the protected person is not a consumer and not an employee.
`an ordinary scope` MEANS
    `mk scope` TRUE `Another kind of contract` `None of these` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE

-- A Part 3 facts record from its fourteen facts, in the order of the DECLARE.
GIVEN `places of business in different States` IS A BOOLEAN
      `goods in the course of carriage between States` IS A BOOLEAN
      `offer and acceptance in different States` IS A BOOLEAN
      `delivery to another State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `Singapore law only by choice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `sea carriage of a passenger` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the order prescribes it` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `authorised by an instrument` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the instrument` IS A `Kind of instrument`
      `to comply with an international agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `not more restrictive than the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `date made` IS A DATE
      `date suffered` IS A DATE
      `section 5 of the Civil Law Act` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Part 3 facts`
`mk part3` MEANS
    `Part 3 facts` OF `places of business in different States`, `goods in the course of carriage between States`, `offer and acceptance in different States`, `delivery to another State`, `Singapore law only by choice`, `sea carriage of a passenger`, `the order prescribes it`, `authorised by an instrument`, `the instrument`, `to comply with an international agreement`, `not more restrictive than the agreement`, `date made`, `date suffered`, `section 5 of the Civil Law Act`

-- A domestic, post-1993 case in which no Part 3 exception is in play.
`an ordinary part 3` MEANS
    `mk part3` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE `Something else` FALSE FALSE (Date 1 3 2024) (Date 1 3 2024) (JUST FALSE)

-- A Dealing facts record from its six facts, in the order of the DECLARE.
GIVEN `party in the course of a business` IS A BOOLEAN
      `party held out` IS A BOOLEAN
      `other in the course of a business` IS A BOOLEAN
      kind IS A `Kind of contract`
      `private use type` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `auction or tender buyer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Dealing facts`
`mk dealing` MEANS
    `Dealing facts` OF `party in the course of a business`, `party held out`, `other in the course of a business`, kind, `private use type`, `auction or tender buyer`
